		"en": [
			"• The MS \"Ifrit Schneid\" of the Zeon Remnant Army, who appears in \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM UC Episode 4 \"At the Bottom of the Well of Gravity\", is finally available as the first HG kit!",
